{"3059000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Loded Depths", "steam_appid": 3059000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the lost secrets of an ancient civilization in <strong>Loded Depths</strong>, a mining and exploration RPG where danger and discovery are buried together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Unique Biomes:</strong> Journey through dark caverns, sprawling forests, marshy swamps, jungle ruins, unforgiving tundra, and volcanic fields — each filled with secrets, resources, and powerful enemies. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Dungeon Bosses:</strong> Face off against terrifying dungeon bosses dwelling in ancient ruins.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mine, Craft, and Build:</strong> Harvest unique resources from every biome to craft powerful tools, construct your expedition base, and survive the depths. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Ancient Mysteries:</strong> Unravel the story of an ancient civilization and uncover technologies lost to time. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and Thrive:</strong> Upgrade your equipment, tame the hostile environments, and turn the dangers of the depths into your greatest strengths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a lone researcher following the legends of an ancient civilization, you embark on a dangerous expedition into a world reclaimed by nature and time. Dig through crumbling tunnels, gather powerful resources, and unlock ancient technology to survive deadly biomes and fearsome dungeon bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><